state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,69,68,53,70,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12007","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,69,68,53,70,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12007","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,69,68,53,70,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12007","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,69,68,53,70,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12007","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1034","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,69,68,53,70,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"8900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12007","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1034","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,69,68,53,70,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12007","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"凉州军阀，本名边允。和韩遂都是凉州有名望的官员。中平元年，羌人北宫伯玉、李文侯反叛，他们二人被劫持，因家乡发布讨贼檄文而被迫加入叛军，并因此改名（边允改边章，韩约改韩遂）。被叛军推举为统帅，拥兵十余万，以诛杀宦官为名攻入三辅，威胁长安和皇陵，导致朝野“天下骚动”。中平二年冬，董卓利用天象动摇叛军军心，发动突袭大破边章、韩遂。边章虽用计断东汉将领周慎粮道，迫其退兵，但大势已去。兵败后，韩遂为夺权，发动兵变，杀死了边章和北宫伯玉等人。","tc":"涼州軍閥，本名邊允。和韓遂都是涼州有名望的官員。中平元年，羌人北宮伯玉、李文侯反叛，他們二人被劫持，因家鄉發布討賊檄文而被迫加入叛軍，并因此改名（邊允改邊章，韓約改韓遂）。被叛軍推舉為統帥，擁兵十余萬，以誅殺宦官為名攻入三輔，威脅長安和皇陵，導致朝野“天下騷動”。中平二年冬，董卓利用天象動搖叛軍軍心，發動突襲大破邊章、韓遂。邊章雖用計斷東漢將領周慎糧道，迫其退兵，但大勢已去。兵敗后，韓遂為奪權，發動兵變，殺死了邊章和北宮伯玉等人。","en":"A warlord of Liang Province, whose original name was Bian Yun. Both he and Han Sui were respected officials in Liang Province. In 184, when the Qiang chieftains Beigong Boyu and Li Wenhou rebelled, the two were taken hostage. Because their home region had issued calls to arms denouncing the rebels, they were compelled to join the insurgency and changed their names accordingly (Bian Yun became Bian Zhang, and Han Yue became Han Sui). Elevated as commanders of the rebellion, they commanded over one hundred thousand troops. Under the banner of punishing the eunuchs, they stormed the Three Adjuncts region, threatening Changan and the imperial tombs, throwing court and country into ‘turmoil throughout the realm’. In the winter of 185, Dong Zhuo exploited celestial omens to unsettle the rebel army and launched a sudden strike that dealt a devastating blow to Bian Zhang and Han Sui. Though Bian Zhang managed to cut off the supply line of the Han general Zhou Shen and force a retreat, the tide had already turned against them. After the defeat, Han Sui staged an internal coup to seize power, killing Bian Zhang, Beigong Boyu, and others.","jp":"涼州の軍閥。本名は辺允。韓遂とともに涼州で名望ある官吏であった。中平元年、羌族の北宮伯玉や李文侯が反乱を起こした際、二人は拉致され、故郷から討賊の檄文が出されたことで叛乱軍への参加を余儀なくされ、これに伴い改名した（辺允は辺章に、韓約は韓遂に改名）。叛乱軍の統帥に推戴され、十余万の兵を擁して宦官誅殺を名目に三輔へ攻め入り、長安と皇陵を脅かして朝野を「天下騒動」たらしめた。中平二年冬、董卓が天象を利用して叛乱軍の軍心を揺さぶり、急襲を仕掛けて辺章・韓遂を大破した。辺章は計略を用いて東漢の将・周慎の糧道を断ち、撤退に追い込んだものの、すでに大勢は決していた。敗戦後、韓遂は権力を奪うべく兵変を起こし、辺章や北宮伯玉らを殺害した。","kr":"양주의 군벌로, 본명은 변윤입니다. 한수와 함께 양주에서 명망 높은 관리였습니다. 중평 원년, 강족의 북궁백옥과 이문후가 반란을 일으켰을 때 두 사람은 위협을 받아 납치되었으며, 고향에서 토적 격문이 발표되자 어쩔 수 없이 반란군에 가담하고 이름까지 바꾸었습니다(변윤은 변장으로, 한약은 한수로 개명). 이후 반란군의 통수로 추대되어 10여 만 군사를 거느리고 환관 주살을 명분으로 삼보로 진격해 장안과 황릉을 위협하니, 조정과 민간에 ‘천하소동’을 일으켰습니다. 중평 2년 겨울, 동탁이 천문을 이용해 반란군의 군심을 흔든 뒤 기습을 감행하여 변장과 한수를 대파했습니다. 변장은 계책을 써서 동한 장수 주신의 군량 운송로를 끊고 퇴각하게 만들었으나 대세는 이미 기운 뒤였습니다. 패전 후, 권력을 장악하려던 한수가 정변을 일으켜 변장과 북궁백옥 등을 살해했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1012315","remark":"","surname":"边","surnameTc":"邊","surnameEn":"Bian","surnameJp":"辺","surnameKr":"변","surnameOther":"","name":"章","nameTc":"章","nameEn":"Zhang","nameJp":"章","nameKr":"장","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"边章","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"0","city":"CS1034","gender":"0","rule":"78","force":"69","wise":"68","politics":"53","charm":"70","will":"67","ruleTalent":"9","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"4","willTalent":"4","weaponMaster":"21/32/31/77/32/76/21/32","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1017802;1002702","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1002605","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"6000","battleSoulPoint":"5000","debateSoulPoint":"5400","strategy":"","strategy2":"1000905","professions":"1/2/2/0/0/0/2/1/0/0/4/3/1/0/2/0/0/2/0/0/0/1/0/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"2","compatible":"0","loyalty":"100","reputation":"8900","evaluate":"-6000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"141","show":"184","death":"187","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"4","weapon":"WP12007","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP